# Ollama's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-ollama-setting-cookie = The ollama.com browser session, needed for quota. Sign in at https://ollama.com/signin, open Developer Tools → Application → Cookies → https://ollama.com, copy the session cookie (wos-session, or __Secure-session on older sign-ins), and paste it as "name=value".
usage-ollama-setting-api-key = An Ollama API key from https://ollama.com/settings/keys. It only verifies access: Ollama shows quota on its website, not through the API.

## The report: the Plan & Billing page's usage windows, or, with an API key,
## how many cloud models it can reach. Ollama Cloud is the product's name,
## and the plan's name stays as the page shows it.

# A window older pages showed in place of the session.
usage-ollama-hourly = Hourly
# The plan line: the report is read with an API key.
usage-ollama-api-key = API key
# How many cloud models the key can reach.
usage-ollama-models = Models
